Under the common trends assumption,
the TWFE coefficient beta, equal to 2.8841, estimates a weighted sum of 267 ATT
> s. 
137 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 130 receive a negative weight.
301 (g,t) cells receive the treatment, but the ATTs of 34 cells receive a weigh
> t equal to zero.
------------------------------------------------
Treat. var: st_stbafl1yr# ATTs      Σ weights  
------------------------------------------------
Positive weights        137         4.7535      
Negative weights        130         -3.7535     
------------------------------------------------
Total                   267         1.0000      
------------------------------------------------

Summary Measures:
TWFE coefficient (β_fe) =    2.8841
min σ(Δ) compatible with β_fe and Δ_TR = 0:    0.2404
min σ(Δ) compatible with treatment effect of opposite sign than β_fe in all (g,
> t) cells:    0.2944
Reference: Corollary 1, de Chaisemartin, C and D'Haultfoeuille, X (2020a)


