. cap noisily twowayfeweights prestout cnty90 year numdailies, type(feTR)

Under the common trends assumption,
the TWFE coefficient beta, equal to 0.0026, estimates a weighted sum of 10056 A
> TTs. 
5919 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 4137 receive a negative weight.
