. /*===========================================================================
> ===
>   STEP 3: TWOWAYFEWEIGHTS DECOMPOSITION — TABLE 1 (Road Expenditure)
> 
>   For twowayfeweights:
>   Y = exp_dens_share, G = distnum, T = year, D = president
>   president is non-binary (it varies by district and changes over time
>   as different presidents from different ethnic groups take power)
> 
>   We use feTR since this is a FE regression (areg with absorb).
> =============================================================================
> =*/
. 
. di _n "============================================================"

============================================================

. di "  STEP 3: TWOWAYFEWEIGHTS — TABLE 1 (Road Expenditure)"
  STEP 3: TWOWAYFEWEIGHTS — TABLE 1 (Road Expenditure)

. di "============================================================"
============================================================

. 
. * Reload Table 1 data (we switched to kenya_roads_pav in Step 2B)
. use "$datadir/kenya_roads_exp", clear

. 
. di "  Data at district x year level: " _N " obs"
  Data at district x year level: 2009 obs

. qui tab distnum

. di "  Districts (G): " r(r)
  Districts (G): 41

. qui tab year

. di "  Years (T): " r(r)
  Years (T): 49

. 
. di _n "  Treatment distribution:"

  Treatment distribution:

. tab president, missing

   Coethnic |
   district |
dummy [d,t] |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          0 |      1,690       84.12       84.12
          1 |        319       15.88      100.00
------------+-----------------------------------
      Total |      2,009      100.00

. 
. * Initialize locals
. local tw_beta_fe  = .

. local tw_npos_fe  = .

. local tw_nneg_fe  = .

. local tw_pct_fe   = "0.0"

. 
. * --- feTR ---
. di _n "============================================================"

============================================================

. di "  feTR (Fixed Effects — Regression 1)"
  feTR (Fixed Effects — Regression 1)

. di "============================================================"
============================================================

. cap noisily twowayfeweights exp_dens_share distnum year president, type(feTR)
>  summary_measures

Under the common trends assumption,
the TWFE coefficient beta, equal to 0.9746, estimates a weighted sum of 319 ATT
> s. 
319 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 0 receive a negative weight.
------------------------------------------------
Treat. var: president   # ATTs      Σ weights  
------------------------------------------------
Positive weights        319         1.0000      
Negative weights        0           0.0000      
------------------------------------------------
Total                   319         1.0000      
------------------------------------------------

Summary Measures:
TWFE coefficient (β_fe) =    0.9746
min σ(Δ) compatible with β_fe and Δ_TR = 0:   21.7407
Reference: Corollary 1, de Chaisemartin, C and D'Haultfoeuille, X (2020a)


The development of this package was funded by the European Union (ERC, REALLYCR
> EDIBLE,GA N°101043899).

. local tw_rc_fe = _rc

. 
. if `tw_rc_fe' == 0 | `tw_rc_fe' == 402 {
.     local tw_beta_fe  = e(beta)
.     mat _M = e(M)
.     local tw_npos_fe  = _M[1,1]
.     local tw_nneg_fe  = _M[2,1]
.     local tw_sumpos   : di %8.4f _M[1,2]
.     local tw_sumneg   : di %8.4f _M[2,2]
. 
.     di _n "  feTR results:"

  feTR results:
.     di "  beta     = " %10.6f `tw_beta_fe'
  beta     =   0.974619
.     di "  pos wgts = " `tw_npos_fe' " (sum = `tw_sumpos')"
  pos wgts = 319 (sum =   1.0000)
.     di "  neg wgts = " `tw_nneg_fe' " (sum = `tw_sumneg')"
  neg wgts = 0 (sum =   0.0000)
.     if `tw_npos_fe' + `tw_nneg_fe' > 0 {
.         local tw_pct_fe : di %5.1f 100*`tw_nneg_fe'/(`tw_npos_fe'+`tw_nneg_fe
> ')
.         di "  % neg    = `tw_pct_fe'%"
  % neg    =   0.0%
.     }
. }

. else {
.     di as error "  feTR failed with rc=`tw_rc_fe'. Using manual fallback."
. 
.     * Manual feTR decomposition
.     qui reg exp_dens_share president i.distnum i.year
.     local tw_beta_fe = _b[president]
. 
.     * Compute weights manually via FE residual
.     qui reg president i.distnum i.year
.     predict eps_D, residual
. 
.     gen w_gt = eps_D
. 
.     qui count if w_gt > 1e-10 & !missing(w_gt)
.     local tw_npos_fe = r(N)
.     qui count if w_gt < -1e-10 & !missing(w_gt)
.     local tw_nneg_fe = r(N)
. 
.     if `tw_npos_fe' + `tw_nneg_fe' > 0 {
.         local tw_pct_fe : di %5.1f 100*`tw_nneg_fe'/(`tw_npos_fe'+`tw_nneg_fe
> ')
.     }
.     else {
.         local tw_pct_fe = "0.0"
.     }
. 
.     di "  beta_fe      = " %10.6f `tw_beta_fe'
.     di "  Positive wgts: `tw_npos_fe'"
.     di "  Negative wgts: `tw_nneg_fe'"
.     di "  % negative   = `tw_pct_fe'%"
. 
.     drop eps_D w_gt
. }

. 
. * --- fdTR ---
. di _n "============================================================"

============================================================

. di "  fdTR (First Differences — Regression 2)"
  fdTR (First Differences — Regression 2)

. di "============================================================"
============================================================

. cap noisily twowayfeweights exp_dens_share distnum year president, type(fdTR)
>  summary_measures
invalid syntax

. local tw_rc_fd = _rc

. 
