the TWFE coefficient beta, equal to 0.0144, estimates a weighted sum of 1075 AT
> Ts. 
483 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 592 receive a negative weight.
1076 (g,t) cells receive the treatment, but the ATTs of 1 cells receive a weigh
> t equal to zero.
