TWFE coefficient (β_fe) =    0.0144
min σ(Δ) compatible with β_fe and Δ_TR = 0:    0.0031
min σ(Δ) compatible with treatment effect of opposite sign than β_fe in all (g,
> t) cells:    0.0044
