. * --- 3a. feTR ---
. di _n "--- feTR decomposition ---"

--- feTR decomposition ---

. cap scalar drop nplus nminus beta sumplus summinus

. cap noisily twowayfeweights lwage dist year amons80, type(feTR) other_treatme
> nts(bmons20) summary_measures

Under the common trends assumption,
the TWFE coefficient beta, equal to 0.0213, estimates the sum of several terms.

The first term is a weighted sum of 1732 ATTs of the treatment.
1712 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 20 receive a negative weight.
------------------------------------------------
Treat. var: amons80     # ATTs      Σ weights  
------------------------------------------------
Positive weights        1712        1.0025      
Negative weights        20          -0.0025     
------------------------------------------------
Total                   1732        1.0000      
------------------------------------------------

The next term is a weighted sum of 1142 ATTs of treatment 1 included in the oth
> er_treatments option.
627 ATTs receive a positive weight, and 515 receive a negative weight.
------------------------------------------------
Other treat.: bmons20   # ATTs      Σ weights  
------------------------------------------------
Positive weights        627         0.0314      
Negative weights        515         -0.0314     
------------------------------------------------
Total                   1142        0.0000      
